BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:YBG Dance Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T120000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17207817@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
DESCRIPTION:Free RSVP\n\nA party\, a workout\, a meditation and a communal
  celebration\, Yerba Buena Gardens Dance Day is a portal to a joyous dance
 -filled world! Presented by YBG Festival and Rhythm & Motion\, YBG Dance D
 ay transforms the Gardens into an outdoor dance heaven where participants 
 can sample dance in a variety of forms and flavors with some of the Bay Ar
 ea’s most talented teachers. Classes are one-hour long and span a wide r
 ange of dance genres. Whether you are new to dance or a seasoned professio
 nal\, Yerba Buena Gardens Dance Day is open to everyone! Bring comfortable
  shoes\, a water bottle and your curiosity for movement – stay for an ho
 ur or the full day. Invite friends and family. This is your day to dance!\
 n\nThis year\, Dance Day honors the life and legacy of Rhythm & Motion fou
 nder Consuelo Faust (1953-2025). We celebrate the spirit she championed 
 – living the belief that anyone can dance and that dance has the power t
 o bring people together in joy. Following the day of classes\, there will 
 be a celebratory music and dance performance that uplifts her vision and t
 he vibrant SF Bay Area dance community she deeply loved and helped to nurt
 ure throughout her life.\n\nFree RSVP\n\nFree\nYerba Buena Gardens Festiva
 l Presents\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.
 eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fybg-dance-day-at-ybg-festival-tickets-1986358348291%3
 Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/11/ybg-
 dance-day-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7850153;-122.4023464
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/31425254/f1457c10-48f7-482f-a58a-cb51b2e0365d.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Yerba Buena Gardens covers two square city blocks bounded by Miss
 ion\, Folsom\, Third and Fourth Streets.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/11/ybg-dance-day-tickets
END:VEVENT
